    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You keep a proverbial wardrobe of costumes ready to summon using your spotlight for just the perfect occasion, including protection against certain enemies. You gain the following role:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Costume:</strong> Creatures with this role gain resistance equal to 2 + your Charisma modifier to any one physical or energy damage type you specify when you used Cast a Role to assign the costume role. This increases to 4 + your Charisma modifier if you are expert in Performance, 6 + your Charisma modifier if you are master in Performance, and 8 + your Charisma modifier if you are Legendary in Performance.</p><p></p></li></ul>",
